    "title": "有名交易者",
    "author": "佚名",
    "status": "Reading",
    "coverColor": "linear-gradient(135deg, #3A6073, #3A6073)",
    "notes": "<strong style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"\">Kristjan Kullamägi</span></strong><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\">（网络昵称&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span class=\"\">Qullamaggie</span></strong><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\">）</span><br><div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\"><br></span></div><div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">他的故事非常传奇：他曾是一名购物中心的保安，用攒下的5000美元开始交易，在经历数次爆仓后，摸索出了一套自己的方法，最终在2021年账户峰值达到约1.05亿美元，位列瑞典全国个人收入榜第15名</span><br></span></div><div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></span></span></div><div><span class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 16px; caret-color: rgb(15, 17, 21); color: rgb(15, 17, 21); font-family: quote-cjk-patch, Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Open Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;\"><ol start=\"1\" style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 18px;\"><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">突破策略 (Breakout)</strong><span class=\"\">：这是他的看家本领。他通过研究历史上数千只大涨的股票，发现它们都呈现“阶梯式”上涨：先是一个</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">30%-100%+</strong><span class=\"\">的迅猛拉升，然后是</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">2周到2个月</strong><span class=\"\">的横盘整理，最后再次向上突破</span><a href=\"https://grokipedia.com/page/Qullamaggies_Breakout_Entry_Strategy#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://breakoutshappen.com/stock-news/how-to-trade-like-qullamaggie-setups-strategy-and-screener\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://cryptoharian.com/dari-us-9-100-hingga-us-80-juta-simak-perjalanan-trader-swedia-ini-dalam-dunia-trading/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 4px; padding-left: 18px;\"><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">筛选</strong><span class=\"\">：只关注过去1、3、6个月内表现排名前1%-2%的强势股</span><a href=\"https://grokipedia.com/page/Qullamaggies_Breakout_Entry_Strategy#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://breakoutshappen.com/stock-news/how-to-trade-like-qullamaggie-setups-strategy-and-screener\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。</span></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">入场</strong><span class=\"\">：在股价放量突破整理区间时买入，通常以开盘区间的高点作为入场信号</span><a href=\"https://grokipedia.com/page/Qullamaggies_Breakout_Entry_Strategy#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://breakoutshappen.com/stock-news/how-to-trade-like-qullamaggie-setups-strategy-and-screener\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。</span></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">止损</strong><span class=\"\">：初始止损设置在入场当天的最低价，且该止损幅度不能超过股票的平均每日波动范围（ADR），以控制单笔风险</span><a href=\"https://breakoutshappen.com/stock-news/how-to-trade-like-qullamaggie-setups-strategy-and-screener\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。</span></p></li></ul></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">事件驱动策略 (Episodic Pivot)</strong><span class=\"\">：这种方法捕捉的是由重大新闻事件引发的股价急剧重估。条件非常苛刻</span><a href=\"https://breakoutshappen.com/stock-news/how-to-trade-like-qullamaggie-setups-strategy-and-screener\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">：</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 4px; padding-left: 18px;\"><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">巨大跳空</strong><span class=\"\">：开盘跳空高开</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">10%</strong><span class=\"\">以上。</span></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">天量成交</strong><span class=\"\">：成交量是平时的</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">10倍</strong><span class=\"\">或更多。</span></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">明确催化剂</strong><span class=\"\">：如超预期的财报、重大合同、监管批准等。</span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\"><br></span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\"><br></span></p><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><span class=\"\"></span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 18px;\"><li><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">极低胜率，极高赔率</strong><span class=\"\">：他的交易胜率只有</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">20%-30%</strong><span class=\"\">，意味着10笔交易里有7-8笔是亏损的。但一旦做对，一笔盈利就能覆盖所有亏损并实现总账户增长</span><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%89%E4%BB%8E%E8%82%A1%E5%B8%82%E8%B5%9A%E5%88%B01%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E/id1757358205?i=1000783707966\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://www.threads.com/@labspeculation/post/DEJgbV0CLqR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5317362333257116.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。</span></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">仓位与风险</strong><span class=\"\">：单笔交易承担的风险仅为账户总资金的</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">0.25%到1%</strong><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%89%E4%BB%8E%E8%82%A1%E5%B8%82%E8%B5%9A%E5%88%B01%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E/id1757358205?i=1000783707966\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5317362333257116.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。他建议持仓过夜的比例不超过总仓位的</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">30%</strong><a href=\"https://cryptoharian.com/dari-us-9-100-hingga-us-80-juta-simak-perjalanan-trader-swedia-ini-dalam-dunia-trading/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。</span></p></li><li style=\"margin-top: 6px;\"><p class=\"ds-markdown-paragraph\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">分步止盈</strong><span class=\"\">：在入场后的</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">3-5天</strong><span class=\"\">，先卖出</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">三分之一到一半</strong><span class=\"\">的仓位锁定利润</span><a href=\"https://grokipedia.com/page/Qullamaggies_Breakout_Entry_Strategy#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/cn/podcast/%E5%BD%93%E4%B8%80%E5%90%8D%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%89%E4%BB%8E%E8%82%A1%E5%B8%82%E8%B5%9A%E5%88%B01%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E/id1757358205?i=1000783707966\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><a href=\"https://www.binance.me/en/square/post/22848389628353#1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"transition: box-shadow var(--ds-transition-duration) var(--ds-ease-in-out); border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); border-image-source: none; border-width: 2px 3px; margin-left: -3px; margin-right: -3px; text-decoration: none; position: relative; cursor: default;\"></a><span class=\"\">。剩余仓位的止损上移至成本价，然后利用</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 600;\">10日或20日均线</strong><span class=\"\">进行跟踪止损，收盘跌破均线则清仓离场</span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ol></span></div>"
  }
